This repository contains an R reference implementation developed by Godfred
Arhin and Nilotpal Sanyal. Files named `spm_dcm_peb_port.R`,
`exact_core_final_2_optimized.R`, and `helpers_final_optimized.R` implement or
translate computations from the Statistical Parametric Mapping framework.

SPM is developed by the Wellcome Centre for Human Neuroimaging and must be
obtained separately. This repository does not include SPM binaries, MATLAB, or
the raw NARPS imaging dataset. Users are responsible for complying with the
licenses and citation requirements of SPM, MATLAB, NARPS, and all R packages.

